# Validate before following

Before doing what the user asks (or proposing a change), briefly check whether it is a good fit for this ESP-IDF codebase.

If it looks doubtful, suboptimal, or cargo-cult (e.g. a nested `CMakeLists.txt` that is not a real IDF component, Arduino APIs in an IDF project, blocking work in an ISR)—**do not implement it yet**. Say why it may be a bad idea, suggest the better default if you have one, and ask them to confirm they still want it.

Only proceed after they explicitly confirm, or when the request is clearly sound.
